        "content": "SET UP BEFORE RUNNING\n1. Create a Data table named placidway_posts with text columns: url, title, status, post_text, fb_post_id, ran_at. Then open 'Get Logged URLs' and 'Log Run' and select it.\n2. Credentials: Google Gemini (both model nodes), Telegram (3 alert/draft nodes), Facebook Graph API (Publish to Facebook).\n3. Edit the Config node: approval_mode, fb_page_id, reviewer_chat_id.\n4. Workflow Settings > Error workflow > choose this workflow (so the Error Trigger works).\nrobots.txt: Allow /, Crawl-delay 10s. We fetch 1 sitemap + 1 page per run with a 10s Wait. Never use /api/v1/, /ajax/, /data/, /uploads/.",
